WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:31.541
In the previous two verses,

2
00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:32.750
Lord Krishna explained

3
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:39.166
how all material and spiritual elements
 of this world have arisen from Him.

4
00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:43.958
He also explained about
 his aparā and parā prakṛti.

5
00:00:43.958 --> 00:00:46.416
Now in this verse, Lord Krishna explains

6
00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:49.500
that whatever exists in this world

7
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.083
is the result of the combination

8
00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:54.375
of these two natures of His.

9
00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:55.375
Along with this,

10
00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:57.083
He explains how He Himself

11
00:00:57.083 --> 00:01:00.208
is connected with this world.

12
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.708
In this verse, Lord Krishna

13
00:01:06.708 --> 00:01:08.666
is explaining this – that the world

14
00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:14.500
is made of two main powers – material power,
 which is His aparā prakrti,

15
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.250
and spiritual power,

16
00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:18.916
which is His parā prakṛti.

17
00:01:18.916 --> 00:01:20.791
Where His material power

18
00:01:20.791 --> 00:01:24.416
creates lifeless matter and substances,

19
00:01:24.416 --> 00:01:27.833
there His spiritual power provides life

20
00:01:27.833 --> 00:01:29.708
and consciousness.

21
00:01:29.708 --> 00:01:32.333
And these very two powers together

22
00:01:32.333 --> 00:01:35.791
become the foundation of the entire
 creation's existence.

23
00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:39.041
An important thing here is

24
00:01:39.041 --> 00:01:42.375
that these two powers arise from Lord Krishna,

25
00:01:42.375 --> 00:01:44.541
who is their original source.

26
00:01:44.541 --> 00:01:46.166
Everything in this world

27
00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:48.541
is an integration of these two powers.

28
00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:51.708
For example, take any machine.

29
00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:53.416
That machine is lifeless,

30
00:01:53.416 --> 00:01:56.250
but when electricity flows through it,

31
00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.958
then we see that machine running,

32
00:01:58.958 --> 00:02:01.625
its various parts appear moving,

33
00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:05.375
as if life has come into the
 lifeless body of the machine.

34
00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:07.208
Now here there are two energies –

35
00:02:07.208 --> 00:02:08.750
one is material energy,

36
00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:11.541
which is directly visible in the machine's parts,

37
00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:13.083
and the second energy is

38
00:02:13.083 --> 00:02:16.416
of that electricity which is running the machine,

39
00:02:16.416 --> 00:02:19.375
but isn't visible, is indirect.

40
00:02:19.375 --> 00:02:21.458
Now think that the construction

41
00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:23.333
of that machine and that electricity

42
00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:25.541
was done by a human, right?

43
00:02:25.541 --> 00:02:28.791
Imagine that working human.

44
00:02:28.791 --> 00:02:31.666
Is only their body working?

45
00:02:31.666 --> 00:02:35.666
No. Because if it was only about the body,

46
00:02:35.666 --> 00:02:37.666
then dead humans would also walk.

47
00:02:37.666 --> 00:02:40.833
A human themselves is also an
 integration of two energies –

48
00:02:40.833 --> 00:02:44.541
one is their material body which eyes can see,

49
00:02:44.541 --> 00:02:45.541
and second

50
00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:49.541
is the soul that gives life to that body.

51
00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:52.916
The body made of material energy we can see,

52
00:02:52.916 --> 00:02:54.708
but the spiritual energy

53
00:02:54.708 --> 00:02:56.875
that makes that human alive,

54
00:02:56.875 --> 00:02:59.250
eyes cannot see that.

55
00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:02.458
Whether it's the example of a
 machine or a human,

56
00:03:02.458 --> 00:03:04.875
indirect energy is also necessary

57
00:03:04.875 --> 00:03:07.708
to run the visible body.

58
00:03:07.708 --> 00:03:10.833
Now whether it's the outer body
 made of material energy,

59
00:03:10.833 --> 00:03:15.000
or the spiritual energy that
 makes that body alive –

60
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.500
both these energies

61
00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.750
are Krishna's powers.

62
00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:21.375
Krishna is also emphasizing this point

63
00:03:21.375 --> 00:03:25.000
that He is the beginning and 
end of the entire creation.

64
00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.000
Creation begins from Him

65
00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:30.375
and ultimately merges into Him.

66
00:03:30.375 --> 00:03:32.541
This shows not only His power

67
00:03:32.541 --> 00:03:35.916
but also His all-pervading form.

68
00:03:35.916 --> 00:03:38.375
Lord Krishna is present everywhere,

69
00:03:38.375 --> 00:03:40.083
present at all times,

70
00:03:40.083 --> 00:03:43.708
present in every small and
 large material element.

71
00:03:43.708 --> 00:03:47.666
And also present in every living plant and being.

72
00:03:47.666 --> 00:03:50.208
It's extremely important to
 understand that nothing

73
00:03:50.208 --> 00:03:53.666
in the world is separate from Krishna.

74
00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:57.375
This is the truth of this world's existence.

75
00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:07.500
Whatever we experience in life

76
00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.958
is a blend

77
00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:13.875
of material and spiritual power.

78
00:04:13.875 --> 00:04:18.125
Our body is made of material substances,

79
00:04:18.125 --> 00:04:22.375
but the source of life and consciousness

80
00:04:22.375 --> 00:04:25.750
in these lifeless substances is

81
00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:27.541
the soul,

82
00:04:27.541 --> 00:04:31.375
which is spiritual power.

83
00:04:31.375 --> 00:04:34.958
Without the soul, the body is only

84
00:04:34.958 --> 00:04:39.000
a lifeless substance.

85
00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.375
But still, most people

86
00:04:42.375 --> 00:04:43.541
remain busy only in

87
00:04:43.541 --> 00:04:47.291
the material aspects of their life –

88
00:04:47.291 --> 00:04:51.083
they worry only about property, position, wealth,

89
00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:55.916
luxury, and physical pleasures,

90
00:04:55.916 --> 00:04:59.791
forget their spiritual form altogether.

91
00:04:59.791 --> 00:05:07.041
As a result, they make these material
 things their identity.

92
00:05:07.041 --> 00:05:11.250
For example, think – how
 much effort a person makes

93
00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.375
to buy a new car, new clothes, new

94
00:05:13.375 --> 00:05:15.708
devices, etc.

95
00:05:15.708 --> 00:05:18.291
But then in just some time,

96
00:05:18.291 --> 00:05:21.208
the mind becomes full with these new things,

97
00:05:21.208 --> 00:05:24.791
and that same person

98
00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:26.333
now once again

99
00:05:26.333 --> 00:05:27.791
sets out in

100
00:05:27.791 --> 00:05:31.458
search of new things.

101
00:05:31.458 --> 00:05:33.958
Such a search

102
00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:36.916
that never ends.

103
00:05:36.916 --> 00:05:38.125
We make this same mistake

104
00:05:38.125 --> 00:05:42.000
with our outer form too.

105
00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.541
Physical appearance, our position,

106
00:05:44.541 --> 00:05:47.583
our existence in society...

107
00:05:47.583 --> 00:05:52.125
We connect our life with these.

108
00:05:52.125 --> 00:05:54.833
And this very attachment to materialism

109
00:05:54.833 --> 00:05:56.833
creates jealousy

110
00:05:56.833 --> 00:06:00.333
and insecurity in us.

111
00:06:00.333 --> 00:06:03.625
Think of this example –

112
00:06:03.625 --> 00:06:06.958
today someone has a big car,

113
00:06:06.958 --> 00:06:08.583
they're very happy,

114
00:06:08.583 --> 00:06:10.000
but then

115
00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.916
the neighbor bought an even bigger car,

116
00:06:13.916 --> 00:06:16.041
then yesterday's happiness

117
00:06:16.041 --> 00:06:18.958
will turn into jealousy today.

118
00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:23.583
Or there will be so much attachment to one's car

119
00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:27.375
that insecurity will remain that someone might

120
00:06:27.375 --> 00:06:31.583
damage that car.

121
00:06:31.583 --> 00:06:34.916
Now think once –

122
00:06:34.916 --> 00:06:36.583
is the neighbor buying a new car

123
00:06:36.583 --> 00:06:41.250
under your control?

124
00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.500
No.

125
00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.833
The car not getting damaged,

126
00:06:44.833 --> 00:06:47.208
is this completely

127
00:06:47.208 --> 00:06:49.750
under your control?

128
00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:52.083
No.

129
00:06:52.083 --> 00:06:59.500
Then how useless it is to be anxious
 about things not in your control.

130
00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:05.875
Under your control is your action, 
your goodness, your wisdom.

131
00:07:05.875 --> 00:07:08.750
And a person pays attention to these

132
00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:12.750
when they get a sense of this truth that

133
00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:16.708
their identity is not this material
 body, but the soul.

134
00:07:16.708 --> 00:07:19.875
When we understand

135
00:07:19.875 --> 00:07:25.791
this balance of material and spiritual power,

136
00:07:25.791 --> 00:07:27.500
then in life those very things

137
00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:29.541
become primary

138
00:07:29.541 --> 00:07:32.666
that are truly important,

139
00:07:32.666 --> 00:07:34.916
that are under our control,

140
00:07:34.916 --> 00:07:37.916
that don't depend on others.

141
00:07:37.916 --> 00:07:39.708
In such a case, a person starts seeking

142
00:07:39.708 --> 00:07:43.583
happiness and peace within themselves.

143
00:07:43.583 --> 00:07:47.458
Not in this outer world's materialism.

144
00:07:47.458 --> 00:07:51.041
Jealousy, insecurity, hatred

145
00:07:51.041 --> 00:07:53.958
all start disappearing automatically.

146
00:07:53.958 --> 00:07:57.500
And as this search becomes deeper,

147
00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:02.541
joy also becomes equally deep.

148
00:08:02.541 --> 00:08:04.916
Seek happiness and peace

149
00:08:04.916 --> 00:08:08.833
within yourself,

150
00:08:08.833 --> 00:08:11.000
not in the world.

151
00:08:15.541 --> 00:08:18.291
All humans have

152
00:08:18.291 --> 00:08:21.041
two identities,

153
00:08:21.041 --> 00:08:22.750
material

154
00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.916
and spiritual,

155
00:08:24.916 --> 00:08:27.333
which are parts of

156
00:08:27.333 --> 00:08:29.625
My aparā

157
00:08:29.625 --> 00:08:32.833
and parā prakṛti.

158
00:08:32.833 --> 00:08:36.000
Whether society or family,

159
00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.375
all individuals have

160
00:08:37.375 --> 00:08:39.500
their own personalities,

161
00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.250
their special qualities,

162
00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:44.750
their capabilities, which determine

163
00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:49.500
what material success they'll get in this life.

164
00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:53.000
But the irony is

165
00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:57.958
that society, and even family sometimes,

166
00:08:57.958 --> 00:09:01.500
judges a person only by their capabilities

167
00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:06.333
and their material successes.

168
00:09:06.333 --> 00:09:09.041
Whereas the truth is

169
00:09:09.041 --> 00:09:12.500
that every person's basic identity

170
00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:15.416
is in their soul-form,

171
00:09:15.416 --> 00:09:21.291
not in their material capabilities and successes.

172
00:09:21.291 --> 00:09:27.166
And everyone's this soul-form basic identity

173
00:09:27.166 --> 00:09:29.250
is a part of Me.

174
00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:33.833
When you view others with this vision,

175
00:09:33.833 --> 00:09:36.208
you'll know two things.

176
00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:39.291
First, that your and

177
00:09:39.291 --> 00:09:42.000
others' real value

178
00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:46.291
is not in materialism, but in spirituality.

179
00:09:46.291 --> 00:09:48.375
And second, that

180
00:09:48.375 --> 00:09:51.500
if everyone is a part of Me,

181
00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.750
then what's the sorrow about being ahead

182
00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:58.083
or behind in competition,

183
00:09:58.083 --> 00:10:00.875
and what's the ego about?

184
00:10:00.875 --> 00:10:03.958
Yes, doing your action well is

185
00:10:03.958 --> 00:10:07.875
necessary, but leave the result

186
00:10:07.875 --> 00:10:09.958
to Me.

187
00:10:09.958 --> 00:10:11.666
For example,

188
00:10:11.666 --> 00:10:16.041
when someone succeeds in some
 competition or game, 

189
00:10:16.041 --> 00:10:17.541
then encouragement and praise

190
00:10:17.541 --> 00:10:18.500
are extremely necessary.

191
00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:21.458
But at such times,

192
00:10:21.458 --> 00:10:25.375
gratitude is equally important.

193
00:10:25.375 --> 00:10:29.750
After all, whatever qualities and
 capabilities there are,

194
00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:34.208
they come from Me. And for Me,

195
00:10:34.208 --> 00:10:35.666
action is necessary,

196
00:10:35.666 --> 00:10:39.750
the purpose behind it is necessary.

197
00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:41.875
Not the result.

198
00:10:41.875 --> 00:10:44.750
This thinking will keep a person humble,

199
00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:46.375
and humility leads

200
00:10:46.375 --> 00:10:49.208
to the path of spirituality.

201
00:10:49.208 --> 00:10:52.250
Leads to true satisfaction.

202
00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:53.458
Similarly,

203
00:10:53.458 --> 00:10:56.333
when someone is struggling,

204
00:10:56.333 --> 00:11:00.208
we should remember that their identity

205
00:11:00.208 --> 00:11:02.458
is far above their material contribution

206
00:11:02.458 --> 00:11:05.250
and success.

207
00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:09.458
A person's value doesn't decrease
 from being successful

208
00:11:09.458 --> 00:11:13.958
or unsuccessful, because their real existence,

209
00:11:13.958 --> 00:11:19.791
their spiritual identity is infinite, indestructible.

210
00:11:19.791 --> 00:11:23.791
This thinking will give humility
 in favorable circumstances

211
00:11:23.791 --> 00:11:28.041
and patience in difficult circumstances.

212
00:11:28.041 --> 00:11:31.750
Also, if everyone is a part of Me,

213
00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:36.125
then why not mutual love?

214
00:11:36.125 --> 00:11:41.333
This thinking will also encourage mutual love.

215
00:11:41.333 --> 00:11:43.208
Think about it.

216
00:11:47.791 --> 00:11:52.500
In any business organization, success

217
00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:56.250
is based on two basic elements –

218
00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:59.000
the people working there,

219
00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:02.833
and available resources.

220
00:12:02.833 --> 00:12:06.666
Where all people are a soul-form,

221
00:12:06.666 --> 00:12:09.625
there all resources

222
00:12:09.625 --> 00:12:13.083
are lifeless material substances.

223
00:12:13.083 --> 00:12:16.833
If you have skilled people

224
00:12:16.833 --> 00:12:19.625
but don't have right equipment

225
00:12:19.625 --> 00:12:22.250
or resources,

226
00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:25.250
then even despite having capability,

227
00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:29.000
expected results won't be obtained.

228
00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:31.041
On the other hand,

229
00:12:31.041 --> 00:12:33.000
if you have modern

230
00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:37.375
facilities, new equipment, but

231
00:12:37.375 --> 00:12:40.916
the people working there are not capable,

232
00:12:40.916 --> 00:12:44.833
not enthusiastic, then even after
 having all those equipment

233
00:12:44.833 --> 00:12:48.583
and facilities,

234
00:12:48.583 --> 00:12:51.291
results will be opposite.

235
00:12:51.291 --> 00:12:54.208
For any organization's success,

236
00:12:54.208 --> 00:12:55.791
both material resources

237
00:12:55.791 --> 00:12:58.291
and capable and enthusiastic people

238
00:12:58.291 --> 00:13:00.333
are necessary.

239
00:13:00.333 --> 00:13:02.250
This is just like

240
00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:06.458
how to run this creation,

241
00:13:06.458 --> 00:13:09.083
both My material and spiritual

242
00:13:09.083 --> 00:13:12.625
power are necessary.

243
00:13:12.625 --> 00:13:15.000
Both materialism and spirituality

244
00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.583
have their own importance.

245
00:13:17.583 --> 00:13:19.500
But more important

246
00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:22.916
than that is remembering

247
00:13:22.916 --> 00:13:25.000
that both these

248
00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.083
are My powers.

249
00:13:27.083 --> 00:13:30.291
This thinking will awaken gratitude in you

250
00:13:30.291 --> 00:13:33.250
toward both people

251
00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.250
and resources.

252
00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:38.666
Will teach respect for both.

253
00:13:38.666 --> 00:13:41.625
Where you'll respect

254
00:13:41.625 --> 00:13:44.000
and encourage people,

255
00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:48.375
there you'll also take good care of
 equipment and resources

256
00:13:48.375 --> 00:13:54.083
considering them as divine help.

257
00:13:54.083 --> 00:13:59.125
Imagine how humble this thinking is.

258
00:13:59.125 --> 00:14:02.000
If you're the owner of some organization

259
00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.416
or a senior officer,

260
00:14:04.416 --> 00:14:08.666
how grateful this thinking will make you.

261
00:14:08.666 --> 00:14:12.208
And gratitude is such a quality

262
00:14:12.208 --> 00:14:18.625
that will help you in both success
 and failure circumstances.

263
00:14:18.625 --> 00:14:21.833
Will protect from ego in success,.

264
00:14:21.833 --> 00:14:26.791
and give patience in failure.

265
00:14:26.791 --> 00:14:31.166
In professional settings, whatever
 you have available,

266
00:14:31.166 --> 00:14:36.541
whether they're people, or facilities,
 or equipment,

267
00:14:36.541 --> 00:14:39.500
consider all as a part of Me,

268
00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:43.541
always remain grateful for all.
